<view class="page paper-grain safe-bottom"><view class="header"><view class="kicker">A NEW ADVENTURE</view><view class="storybook-title title">{{mode === 'ai' ? '把期待交给小帮手' : '写下一趟旅行'}}</view><view class="subtitle">信息越具体，路线越贴近你们一家。</view></view><view class="form"><label>从哪里出发<input data-field="departure" value="{{form.departure}}" bindinput="input" /></label><label>想去哪里<text class="required">*</text><input data-field="destination" value="{{form.destination}}" placeholder="例如：南疆" bindinput="input" /></label><view class="date-row"><label>出发日期<picker mode="date" value="{{form.startDate}}" bindchange="pickDate" data-field="startDate"><view class="picker">{{form.startDate}}</view></picker></label><label>返程日期<picker mode="date" value="{{form.endDate}}" bindchange="pickDate" data-field="endDate"><view class="picker">{{form.endDate}}</view></picker></label></view><label>交通方式<input data-field="transport" value="{{form.transport}}" bindinput="input" /></label><label>同行成员<input data-field="travelers" value="{{form.travelers}}" bindinput="input" /></label><label>女儿当时年龄<input data-field="childAge" value="{{form.childAge}}" bindinput="input" /></label><label>喜欢什么<input data-field="interests" value="{{form.interests}}" bindinput="input" /></label><label>希望的节奏<input data-field="pace" value="{{form.pace}}" bindinput="input" /></label><label>一定想去（用顿号分隔）<input data-field="mustGo" value="{{form.mustGo}}" placeholder="例如：莎车、塔县" bindinput="input" /></label><label>预算（可选）<input data-field="budget" value="{{form.budget}}" placeholder="例如：全家 2 万元" bindinput="input" /></label></view><view class="hint">AI 只生成可编辑草案；开放、预约、路况、价格和高海拔信息都需要出发前再次核验。</view><button class="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? '正在画路线…' : '生成旅行草案'}}</button></view>
